    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/7b60be06ef3dce94d1fd5d618353302a.avif?t=1750939365\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for chaos! In <strong>Silent Survivor</strong>, you control unique heroes fighting off relentless hordes in intense survival arenas. Your goal? <strong>Last as long as possible</strong> \u2014 and that takes more than brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, upgrade your skills, strategize, and <strong>evolve in real time</strong> as the danger ramps up every second. Manage your upgrades wisely \u2014 every decision could be the difference between survival and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A variety of heroes with distinct playstyles<br>\ud83d\udd39 Ever-growing and challenging enemies<br>\ud83d\udd39 Dynamic progression system based on resource collection<br>\ud83d\udd39 Fast-paced combat focused on survival and strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last before the horde overwhelms you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/4d72465b443115c8e31d695a6fdd06dd.poster.avif?t=1750939365\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/4d72465b443115c8e31d695a6fdd06dd.webm?t=1750939365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/4d72465b443115c8e31d695a6fdd06dd.mp4?t=1750939365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/7b60be06ef3dce94d1fd5d618353302a.avif?t=1750939365\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for chaos! In <strong>Silent Survivor</strong>, you control unique heroes fighting off relentless hordes in intense survival arenas. Your goal? <strong>Last as long as possible</strong> \u2014 and that takes more than brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, upgrade your skills, strategize, and <strong>evolve in real time</strong> as the danger ramps up every second. Manage your upgrades wisely \u2014 every decision could be the difference between survival and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A variety of heroes with distinct playstyles<br>\ud83d\udd39 Ever-growing and challenging enemies<br>\ud83d\udd39 Dynamic progression system based on resource collection<br>\ud83d\udd39 Fast-paced combat focused on survival and strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last before the horde overwhelms you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/4d72465b443115c8e31d695a6fdd06dd.poster.avif?t=1750939365\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/4d72465b443115c8e31d695a6fdd06dd.webm?t=1750939365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/4d72465b443115c8e31d695a6fdd06dd.mp4?t=1750939365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
